@startuml error_handling_sequence_interceptor

participant "前端\n(Repository/API层)" as FE
participant "OkHttp\nResponseInterceptor" as RI
participant "后台(Controller)" as BFF
participant "RestTemplate" as RT
participant "RestClientErrorHandler" as EH
participant "后端服务(BA/ABA)" as BE
participant "POPWindowsUtil\n(LiveData)" as POP
participant "UI层\n(全局错误Dialog)" as UI

FE -> RI : ①发起请求(chain.request())
activate RI
RI -> BFF : ②chain.proceed(request)
BFF -> RT : 调用后端接口
RT -> BE : ③转发HTTP请求
BE --> RT : 返回错误(4xx/5xx)
RT -> EH : ④hasError()=true\n触发handleError()

note over EH
  解析Body,判断BA/ABA
  组装errorCode/errorMsg
end note

EH --> BFF : ⑤抛出对应异常\n(如BadRequestException)
BFF --> RI : ⑥返回错误Response

alt HTTP 200(且API_SERVICE_NAME=APIGW)
    RI -> RI : newResponseCreate()\n解密响应体
else HTTP 412(公開鍵/トークン期限切れ)
    RI -> RI : RefreshLogic.az0903()\n刷新令牌
    alt 刷新成功
        RI -> BFF : signedRequest()\n重新签名并重试请求
    else 刷新失败
        RI -> RI : ⑦showErrorMsgDialog(it)
    end
else HTTP 426(APPバージョン更新)
    RI -> RI : VersionUpdateUtil.postValue(errorCode, errorMessage)
else HTTP 400 / 418 / 500
    RI -> RI : ⑦showErrorMsgDialog(it)
else HTTP 530(メンテナンス中)
    RI -> POP : POPWindowsUtil.postValue(维护中消息)
else 其他状态码(API_401_RETRY_FLAG=true)
    RI -> RI : 解析ErrorResponseBean
    RI -> POP : POPWindowsUtil.postValue(errorMsg)
end

note over RI
  showErrorMsgDialog内部:
  1.解析ErrorResponseBean(errorCode/errorMessage)
  2.editErrorMsg()按API_SERVICE_NAME\n定制errorMsg/errorTitle
end note

alt errorCode == MBFS0008
    RI -> RI : MBFS0008ErrorUtil.postValue(errorMsg)\n(交由Page层自行处理,不弹通用Dialog)
else 其他errorCode
    RI -> POP : POPWindowsUtil.postValue(errorMsg, errorTitle, errorCode)
end

deactivate RI

RI --> FE : (网络层异常IOException时)\nonFailure: 非Canceled则同样调用POPWindowsUtil.postValue

POP -> UI : ⑧通知LiveData变化
UI -> UI : ⑨展示错误 AlertDialog

@enduml
